<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Thunder Kid</title>
</head>
<style>
    body{
        background-color: navy;
        color: white;
        font-family: sans-serif;
    }
    .hero-name{
        font-size: 60px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: yellow;
        text-shadow: 5px 5px orange;
    }
    .tagline{
        font-style: italic;
        color: lightblue;
        text-transform: capitalize;
    }
    .label{
        text-transform: uppercase;
        text-decoration: underline;
        color: sandybrown;
    }
    .power{
        font-weight: bold;
        color: lightgreen;
    }
    .weakness{
        text-decoration: line-through underline overline;
        color: grey;
    }
    .badge{
        font-size: 30px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: gold;
        transform: rotate(5deg);
    }
    .made-by{
        color: orange;
        font-size: 20px;
        text-shadow: 3px 3px rgb(173, 95, 0);
        font-family: Impact, Haettenschweiler, 'Arial Narrow Bold', sans-serif;
        font-style: italic;
    }
</style>
<body>
    <h1 class="hero-name">Thunder Kid</h1>

<p class="tagline">the most powerful hero in the school</p>

<h2 class="label">super powers</h2>

<p class="power">Can run faster than a cheetah</p>

<p class="power">Can lift a school bus</p>

<h2 class="label">weaknesses</h2>

<p class="weakness">Maths homework</p>

<p class="weakness">Broccoli</p>

<p class="badge">Top Hero</p>

<p class="made-by">Created by Tejas Thandale</p>
</body>
</html>
